          "message": "perf: stream Wing stdjson responses into pooled buffers\n\nStream Wing stdjson JSON serialization responses into a response-owned buffer, add focused tests, and record local plus tiger evidence. The default Sonic response path remains unchanged, and the evidence keeps the Actix claim boundary at same-ballpark for the broader diagnostic workload.",
