          "message": "release: stamp v1.3.0 and record cross-rival claims in guides\n\nDate the 1.3.0 CHANGELOG section and update the performance and Fiber migration guides to the committed v1.3.0 evidence: the claim gate passes against both Actix and Fiber on every benchmark route (queries versus Fiber on the default Sonic build), with the netpoll takeover p99 trade noted. Claim rule generalized from Actix-only to any rival. Pre-release script all green.",
