          "id": "885611784f9fbcc1389c5a59838aac9f53daa13f",
          "message": "Wing: adaptive spin before netpoller park on takeover keep-alive read\n\nPerf-track P1 (v1.3.1): bounded non-blocking spin before the netpoller park on the Takeover keep-alive read. Fixes /queries throughput p99 (was +11.33% over Fiber, now -14.8%); every db/queries cell beats Fiber on RPS and p99. No API change. Evidence: bench/reproducible/results/2026-06-13-takeover-spin-p99-evidence.md.",
