          "message": "bench: runtime footprint measurement + finding\n\nPerf-track P3 (v1.3.1): measure-first footprint. tiger startup 5ms, idle RSS 13.79MB, binary 21.9MB (stdjson)/26.6MB (Sonic). Already lean; Go-runtime+dep dominated; knobs (kruda_stdjson, GOGC/GOMEMLIMIT) already documented. Adds footprint.sh. No production change. Evidence: bench/reproducible/results/2026-06-13-footprint-evidence.md.",
