          "id": "b231dd0b89a4b5e71bf948d11dc4f6cdfe8fa2dc",
          "message": "bench: low-concurrency latency profiles + finding\n\nPerf-track P4 (v1.3.1): opt-in BENCH_LOWC=1 profiles (c8/16/32) + finding. Kruda leads RPS at every concurrency; p99 better-or-equal from c16 up (P1 spin helps DB tail even at low load). Only c8 plaintext p99 (0.25 vs 0.07ms, sub-ms) favors Fiber — immaterial. Harness only, no production change. Evidence: bench/reproducible/results/2026-06-13-low-concurrency-evidence.md.",
