          "message": "feat: opt-in RFC 9457 problem+json error responses\n\nAdd one-line opt-in RFC 9457 application/problem+json error responses plus fluent KrudaError builders (WithType/WithDetail/WithInstance/With). Additive and non-breaking: default error shape unchanged, WithErrorHandler still takes precedence. Targets v1.4.0.",
