          "id": "1eed571b1e16b76c7d7683322b736daa82854379",
          "message": "bench: add realistic API profile route across kruda/fiber/actix\n\nAdd an opt-in /realworld-profile/:id route implemented identically across kruda/fiber/actix: route param, query validation, an auth-token gate, X-Request-Id handling, one PostgreSQL read, and a nested JSON response envelope. Claimed separately from CPU-only and DB-only results.\n\nHarden bench.sh: route-name filename slugs, git-worktree-aware metadata, fiber/actix version capture. Bump fiber bench module to v2.52.13.\n\nIncludes 2026-06-14 tiger evidence: RPS parity with Fiber at the PostgreSQL ceiling with a p99 win, ~190% RPS over Actix.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-14T21:35:57+07:00",
