          "distinct": true,
          "id": "4e9d3004880e8fb59aa60f0b8887ea7846a7001b",
          "message": "ci: enforce doc correctness for exported APIs and current guides\n\nAdd two release gates wired into CI so documentation defects fail the build instead of shipping silently.\n\n- scripts/check-godoc.sh: fails when an exported symbol in a released module lacks a doc comment; checks root + every contrib module + cmd/kruda across linux/darwin/windows; fails hard if revive is missing.\n- scripts/check-docs.sh: fails when current docs (guide, api, release-process, README) reference removed Wing helper APIs or describe the deleted transport/wing shim as live.\n\npre-release.sh delegates to both. test.yml runs the godoc check per-PR (revive pinned v1.12.0); docs.yml runs the docs check. Also fixes stale WingStaticText/WingStaticJSON references in transport.md and security.md (renamed to StaticText/StaticJSON in v1.3.0).",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-15T11:00:30+07:00",
          "tree_id": "d4173606e46034f5bfeeec3866c1f61bc80caec9",
          "url": "https://github.com/go-kruda/kruda/commit/4e9d3004880e8fb59aa60f0b8887ea7846a7001b"
