          "distinct": true,
          "id": "927c066403887466e70c7664ffd6688ff749e17c",
          "message": "fix(wing): shared takeover body budget + pipelined-after-body byte preservation\n\n- Takeover path now charges and refunds the per-worker in-flight body budget\n  (MaxInflightBodyBytes), returning 503 when exceeded. Total in-flight body\n  memory is now bounded across both the event-loop and Takeover paths.\n- Preserve pipelined bytes that arrive in the same read as a request body:\n  relocate the surplus past Content-Length, and drain already-buffered\n  pipelined bytes once the body completes (edge-triggered epoll does not\n  re-notify for bytes already in the read buffer).",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-19T21:35:29+07:00",
          "tree_id": "701b4d7b0471fa56ed454da160e03486df54f6d5",
          "url": "https://github.com/go-kruda/kruda/commit/927c066403887466e70c7664ffd6688ff749e17c"
