          "distinct": true,
          "id": "2ba7676626c5be625c5d33dece03069cc15a56ca",
          "message": "feat(wing): accept-side DoS limits — connection cap, per-IP, accept-rate\n\nAdds accept-time connection limits to the Wing transport: a global total cap (CAS reserve; default derived from RLIMIT_NOFILE), plus opt-in per-IP limit and accept-rate token bucket — all enforced on the accept path only, closing over-limit connections with a TCP RST (never an HTTP status). Peer IP captured zero-alloc via raw accept4; a single removeConnBookkeeping chokepoint does the accounting. Removes the now-dead WingConfig.MaxConnsPerWorker field (breaking, ADR 0001). Validated on Linux/epoll under -race and a paired tiger A/B (no hot-path regression).",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-21T15:24:24+07:00",
          "tree_id": "ce3ec57216c4b732291f0cfeb1815dd3ee1237b6",
          "url": "https://github.com/go-kruda/kruda/commit/2ba7676626c5be625c5d33dece03069cc15a56ca"
