          "id": "2e67c2053b8d4b5273d4fae65e14c6871183fc67",
          "message": "fix(prometheus): defer in-flight gauge Dec so a panic can't leak it\n\nrequestsInFlight.Dec() ran after c.Next(), so a panicking handler (recovered\nat the serve level, above this middleware) skipped the decrement and leaked\nthe gauge by 1 per panic. Defer it right after Inc(). Regression test drives a\npanicking handler with prometheus as the only middleware and asserts the gauge\nreturns to 0.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-21T21:40:00+07:00",
          "tree_id": "bebbc508212f99097903c83bd62b8ae8688862cc",
