          "id": "2b6c917a3d1ab6cd3033a27fd7a1f8cdac9dcc02",
          "message": "docs: fix v1.4.0 release-record gaps found in review\n\nPre-tag review caught release-record accuracy issues; this fixes them. Add contrib/observability to the user-facing contrib listings (count 10->11 across README, docs/guide/contrib.md, docs/index.md); scope the README benchmark revalidation to what the evidence supports (reversed-order confirmation covered the DB-bound routes; CPU-route p99 values are sub-millisecond) and back it with absolute numbers in the evidence file; clarify the MaxConnsPerWorker migration as a per-worker -> server-wide-total semantics change. No .go changes.",
