          "id": "bca09be131e361c83cb2a54b815484bcd51128c2",
          "message": "fix(wing): anti-smuggling parser hardening + shutdown/soak quality gates\n\nDifferential fuzzer (Wing parser vs net/http) found and fixed real request-smuggling-class bugs: obs-fold on any header line, whitespace before header colons, duplicate Host headers, a method-interning hash collision, malformed HTTP-version/method/CR handling. Fuzzer wired into pre-release.sh. Adds a shutdown-drain regression gate for SSE streams and a reusable soak-test harness (goroutine/RSS stability under load). No API changes; all fixes verified against real net/http behavior before landing.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-03T23:30:54+07:00",
          "tree_id": "df4cedc707343a401fec258dec70ca7af11110fa",
