          "distinct": true,
          "id": "caa59abac4b0aacbd91f156b0aabb3e6b1b57c4b",
          "message": "docs: Wing protocol matrix, production TLS, and Use()-after-routes warning\n\nDocs-honesty bundle: a Wing protocol-support matrix page, production-TLS deployment guidance (terminate in front of Wing; direct WithTLS falls back to net/http), a one-time warning when Use() is called after routes, and removal of the stale transport/wing require. Also fixes a flaky WS-over-Wing test harness (returned an address before the server was accepting) and corrects the stale 'Wing doesn't support SSE' doc. Ships in the next release.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-04T21:07:49+07:00",
          "tree_id": "109de75d96e74696f19a2cd11a576ae988235ec0",
          "url": "https://github.com/go-kruda/kruda/commit/caa59abac4b0aacbd91f156b0aabb3e6b1b57c4b"
